# budget from 400-partial-redundancy-elimination.ref: the course solution's count, widened by 10% and rounded up, plus one, and at least three more than the count
instructions <= 40
blocks <= 15
count(call) <= 6
count(load) <= 3
count(store) <= 3
count(phi) <= 7
instructions <= 11 in @full_redundancy
instructions <= 12 in @partial_redundancy
instructions <= 9 in @keep_critical_edge
instructions <= 12 in @main

# outcomes from 400-partial-redundancy-elimination.ref: what the course solution removed stays removed (a call inlined, memory promoted, a definition pruned)
none(phi)
